      "desc:8": "3, 2, 1... The Satellite Launch Pad is a whole launch complex: a pad of Clean Stainless Steel Machine Casings round a flame pit, a service tower behind it with an Input Bus for rockets in its base, a propellant tank with an Input Hatch for rocket fuel, lightning masts, and an Energy Hatch and a Maintenance Hatch on the pad's front edge. Keep the sky open over the pit.%n%nA launch takes 30 seconds at 480 EU/t and 1,000 L of fuel, and puts a satellite into orbit over the pad's dimension. Build the pad and watch your first satellite go up.%n%nMore in the guide: [guide page=becom:space.md]Space and other dimensions[/guide].",
